    Same mechanism as left gripper - see left gripper comments for details.
    
    Structure:
      right_base_link (palm)
        └─ right_Link1 (finger 1 base) ─ right_Link11 (finger 1 tip)
        └─ right_Link2 (finger 2 base) ─ right_Link22 (finger 2 tip)
    
